Date: Sun, 1 Feb 2026 13:25:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: Adapt queries for Spell Editor compatible schema
 (F-045)

Updated SQL queries to match the camelCase column naming convention
used by WoW Spell Editor:
- TalentTab: Name1, iconId, classMask, orderIndex, etc.
- Talent: talentTabId, tierId, spellRank1-9, prereqTalent1-3, etc.
- Spell: SpellName0, SpellIconID, SpellDescription0
- ChrClasses: Id, Name1, PetNameToken

Also fixed lowercase table name in insertTalent max ID query.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
