Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: Zeppelin dbc schema + custom-icon overlay (F-045)

- db_queries.go: query the DBCTool/Zeppelin `dbc` schema (name_enus,
  spec_id, rank_1, spell_name_enus, spell_icon_id, ...) so the editor
  reads our live database instead of the WoW-Spell-Editor schema.
- talent_editor.go: overlay an on-disk custom_icons/ folder on the
  embedded icon set at runtime, so custom talent icons appear without
  rebuilding the editor (folder synced by `zep build patch-mpq -p I`).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
